  "cooked": "<p>Here\u2019s a top movers view on node count change per ASN:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7ae839ef1b882e2fe0d73627040bfa6309f2107f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/7ae839ef1b882e2fe0d73627040bfa6309f2107f\" title=\"Top 25 gainers and losers in node count since 2025-07-10 (Bitnodes data)\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7ae839ef1b882e2fe0d73627040bfa6309f2107f_2_556x500.png\" alt=\"Top 25 gainers and losers in node count since 2025-07-10 (Bitnodes data)\" data-base62-sha1=\"hxhNdYqWnNQpXlDzwOTC8IIfIx9\" width=\"556\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7ae839ef1b882e2fe0d73627040bfa6309f2107f_2_556x500.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7ae839ef1b882e2fe0d73627040bfa6309f2107f_2_834x750.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7ae839ef1b882e2fe0d73627040bfa6309f2107f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EEEEEB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Top 25 gainers and losers in node count since 2025-07-10 (Bitnodes data)</span><span class=\"informations\">989\u00d7889 122 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And here over time:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/63f1b1712c19cbfe5f6681c24ce29fbef77fc377.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/63f1b1712c19cbfe5f6681c24ce29fbef77fc377\" title=\"Gainers and loosers over time\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/63f1b1712c19cbfe5f6681c24ce29fbef77fc377_2_690x491.png\" alt=\"Gainers and loosers over time\" data-base62-sha1=\"eg95S7nrfOtnido0POW0jTd8MpV\" width=\"690\" height=\"491\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/63f1b1712c19cbfe5f6681c24ce29fbef77fc377_2_690x491.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/63f1b1712c19cbfe5f6681c24ce29fbef77fc377_2_1035x736.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/63f1b1712c19cbfe5f6681c24ce29fbef77fc377_2_1380x982.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Gainers and loosers over time</span><span class=\"informations\">1389\u00d7989 222 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The gains in AMAZON-02, Google Cloud Plattform spike up in early October 2025. Wiz K.K. (the mempool space ISP) loss around 2025-10-20 seem interesting, but could also be a data error in Bitodes data, and OVH losing nodes is interesting too. The OVH timing dropping in January and Feburary doesn\u2019t really match the <a href=\"https://blog.ovhcloud.com/pricing-evolution-of-public-cloud-bare-metal-and-vps-at-ovhcloud/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Pricing evolution of Public Cloud, Bare Metal and VPS at OVHcloud - OVHcloud Blog</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://us.ovhcloud.com/resources/blog/pricing-evolution-of-public-cloud-bare-metal-and-vps-at-ovhcloud/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Pricing Evolution of Public Cloud, Bare Metal and VPS at OVHcloud</a> price increase they annouced. Otherwise, this could have been a reason.</p>",
